 <h3><u>Aisa lagta hai hasan</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>HAYE HASAN HAYE HASAN AYE HASAN AYE HASAN HAYE HASAN HAAYE HASAN<br> HAYE HASAN HAYE HASAN AYE HASAN AYE HASAN HAYE HASAN HAAYE HASAN</p> 
  <p>AISA LAGTA HAI HASAN DO BAAR KAFNAE GAYE..(2)</p> 
  <p>SOCHKAR PHATTA HAI DIL KITNE SITAM DHAAYE GAYE</p> 
  <p>AISA LAGTA HAI HASAN DO BAAR KAFNAE GAYE..(2)</p> 
  <p>TUKDE TUKDE ZAHER DEKAR PAHLE KAR DAALA JIGAR<br> BAAD ME YE ZULM&nbsp; BHI DHAAYA GAYA MAZLOOM&nbsp; PAR<br> KABR TAK JAANE SE ROKA TEER BARSAE GAYE</p> 
  <p>AISA LAGTA HAI HASAN DO BAAR KAFNAE GAYE..(2)</p> 
  <p>LAUT KAR AAYI JO MAYYAT GHAR ME KABRUSTAN SE<br> YU LAGA JAISE TAPAKTA HAI LAHOO QURAAN SE<br> ZAINABO KULSOOM&nbsp; KO PHIR ZAKHM&nbsp; DIKHLAE GAYE</p> 
  <p>AISA LAGTA HAI HASAN DO BAAR KAFNAE GAYE..(2)</p> 
  <p>ZABT KIS DIL SE KIYA AHADE VAFA KE PAAS NE<br> JAANE KITNI BAAR ULTI AASTEE ABBAS NE<br> VO TO KAHIYE HAZRATE SHABBIR SAMJHAE GAYE</p> 
  <p>AISA LAGTA HAI HASAN DO BAAR KAFNAE GAYE..(2)</p> 
  <p>KYA KISI KE SAATH PEHLE BHI KABHI AISA HUA<br> KYA KISI KO DAFN KARNE SE KAHEE ROKA GAYA<br> KOI TO BATLAE KYU YE ZULM DOHRAE GAYE</p> 
  <p>AISA LAGTA HAI HASAN DO BAAR KAFNAE GAYE..(2)</p> 
  <p>AHMADE MUKHTAR KHUD NAAQA BANE JISKE LIYE<br> APNI ZULFE HAATH ME DEKAR CHALE JISKE LIYE<br> HAAYE USKI LAASH PAR PATTHAR BHI BARSAE GAYE</p> 
  <p>AISA LAGTA HAI HASAN DO BAAR KAFNAE GAYE..(2)</p> 
  <p>DEKHKAR BHAI KA LAASHA DER TAK ROE HUSSAIN<br> KAISE DOHRAE KIYE&nbsp; JO ZAINABE MUZTAR NE BAEN<br> UMME FARWA AUR QASIM GASH PE GASH KHAAYE GAYE</p> 
  <p>AISA LAGTA HAI HASAN DO BAAR KAFNAE GAYE..(2)</p> 
  <p>JISME ATHAR PE NA JAANE ZAKHM KITNE KHAAYE HAI<br> AISA LAGTA HAI PAHEN KAR SURKH JODA AAYE HAI<br> KHU TAPAKTA THA BADAN SE GHAR ME JAB LAAYE GAYE</p> 
  <p>AISA LAGTA HAI HASAN DO BAAR KAFNAE GAYE..(2)</p> 
  <p>NANA KE PEHLU&nbsp; ME MIL JAATI AGAR DO GAZ ZAMEE<br> CHAEN SE MARQAD ME SO JAATA YE JANNAT KA MAKEE<br> KYU NA HAQDAARO KA HAQ AAKHIR NA DILWAE GAYE</p> 
  <p>AISA LAGTA HAI HASAN DO BAAR KAFNAE GAYE..(2)</p> 
  <p>DASTANE RANJO GHAM ASIF KARU KAISA BAYA<br> DAR SATAATA HAI YE AAMIR GIR NA JAAYE AASMA<br> AKRABA MAYYAT HASAN KI LAAYE LE JAAYE GAYE</p> 
  <p>AISA LAGTA HAI HASAN DO BAAR KAFNAE GAYE..(2)</p> 
